{"id":"1ef25f2aaccc6b2e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolySemanticInput.md","title":"PolySemanticInput","display":"PolySemanticInput","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolySemanticInput","parameters":["D","d","rho","a","R"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolySemanticInput"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>d</span><span>rho</span><span>a</span><span>R</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>d</code>、<code>rho</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>R</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolySemanticInput D d rho a R)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ PolyTy d a) (and (@ PolyTypeEnv D d rho) (@ PartialEquiv D R)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"558dd759e3fb9283\" href=\"?note=558dd759e3fb9283\" title=\"ZFC_PartialEquiv\">PartialEquiv</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8ed31ea0d65b588\" href=\"?note=d8ed31ea0d65b588\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTy\">PolyTy</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"294a0279fb052c72\" href=\"?note=294a0279fb052c72\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTypeEnv\">PolyTypeEnv</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式"